# Cursor Commands Best Practices

Best practices for creating effective Cursor IDE custom commands (slash commands). Ensures commands are clear, reusable, well-documented, and follow single responsibility principle.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Creating custom Cursor commands
- Writing slash commands
- Designing command interfaces
- Need command best practices

